# 2. PRODUCT OVERVIEW

Product Name: Festivo AI

Tagline: Your Celebration, Planned Smarter.

Product Description:

Festivo AI is an AI-powered event planning platform designed primarily for Indian users.

It helps users organize weddings, birthdays, anniversaries, college festivals, corporate events, and community celebrations.

Users enter their event information and budget. Gemini generates a personalized planning strategy containing:

* Event overview.
* Budget allocation.
* Preparation timeline.
* Task checklist.
* Vendor categories.
* Decoration ideas.
* Food suggestions.
* Guest planning.
* Event-day schedule.
* Personalized recommendations.

Users can subsequently manage their events through an interactive dashboard and an AI chat assistant.

The entire application must be responsive and functional on desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.

